**/node_modules
.git
.github
data
.claude
.playwright-mcp
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
# Dockerfiles COPY whole directories (packages, apps/web, apps/workers) into
# the build context; a local .env would otherwise land in an image layer and
# in the release artifact. Keep the example file so it stays documented.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Nothing an image builds or runs. Leaving tests and docs out of the context
# also keeps a test- or docs-only commit from invalidating any image layer, so
# it rebuilds to the same image and the stand deploy has nothing to change.
docs
scripts
**/*.md
**/test
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/workers/_test-shared
# Vendored from the installed monaco-editor during the web build; a stale local
# copy must not stand in for it.
apps/web/public/monaco
